# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# No data belongs in this repository.
#
# Neither the source cohort files nor anything derived from them is
# redistributed here: not the expression matrices, not the cross-validation
# splits, not the per-subtype summary statistics, not the synthetic samples
# built from those statistics. Everything below is produced locally by the
# user, from a file the user obtained themselves. See DATA.md.
#
# NOTE: these rules cover the DEFAULT output location, data/. Pass a different
# --data-dir and the output lands outside them. Check `git status` before
# committing, and publish from a fresh repository rather than one whose history
# might already contain such a directory.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
results/
demo/generated/

# The release archive and anything taken out of it.
TMP_v12_*.tar.gz
TMP_v12_*.tar.gz.part
*_v12_*.tsv
*_CVfolds_*.tsv

# Superseded: an earlier release derived synthetic samples from per-subtype
# summary statistics of a real cohort. That path is gone, but a working tree
# from before it was removed may still hold the files.
tcga_summary_statistics*
tcga_synthetic*

*.tsv
*.npz
*.parquet

# Model checkpoints are downloaded by the tabpfn package into its own cache.
*.ckpt

# Example output
toy_gene_expression.tsv

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
